# Component conventions

**Canonical doc:** `components/CLAUDE.md`

## Layout

Flat `components/` — no feature subfolders except `OptimisticSortOrder/` (server `index.tsx` + client `index.client.tsx`).

## Exports & styling

- Named exports (default only on legacy `ImageBox.tsx`)
- Tailwind inline; conditionals via template literals — **no `cn()` / `clsx`**
- Async server components OK when you need `await draftMode()`

## Types

- Prefer `@/sanity.types` (generated). Narrow types in `@/types` only when needed.
- Never hand-edit `sanity.types.ts`

## Portable text & images

- All rich text through **`CustomPortableText.tsx`** — extend it for new block types
- Sanity images through **`ImageBox`** + `urlForImage`

## Visual editing

- `createDataAttribute` + `data-sanity` for Presentation overlays on arrays/derived values
- `stegaClean()` when you need raw strings (conditions, `Date`, etc.)
- `OptimisticSortOrder/` pattern: lazy client half only in draft mode
